@startuml backend_architecture
title Backend Architecture - UML Component Diagram

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false

component "Tutoring.Api" as Api
component "Tutoring.Infrastructure" as Infrastructure
component "Tutoring.Domain" as Domain
component "Tutoring.UnitTest" as UnitTests <<test>>
component "Tutoring.IntegrationTests" as IntegrationTests <<test>>
component "MediatR" as MediatR <<library>>
component "SQL Server" as SqlServer <<database>>

Api ..> Infrastructure : project reference
Infrastructure ..> Domain : project reference
Api ..> Domain : uses domain types
Api ..> MediatR : dispatches requests
Infrastructure ..> SqlServer : EF Core

UnitTests ..> Api : project reference
UnitTests ..> Domain : tests domain types
UnitTests ..> Infrastructure : tests password policy
IntegrationTests ..> Api : hosts API
IntegrationTests ..> Infrastructure : verifies persistence
IntegrationTests ..> Domain : creates/asserts domain state
IntegrationTests ..> UnitTests : project reference

@enduml
